## Committing to the hub (this repo)

`main` is protected — direct pushes blocked, PR required. No required reviewers or checks, so
clean PRs auto-merge the moment they're mergeable.

```bash
git checkout -b {handle}/{short-slug}
# edits
git add -A && git commit
scripts/ship.sh            # pushes, opens PR, enables auto-merge, waits for merge, syncs main
```

**When to push:** after writing a finding, editing this file, changing a skill (then re-run
`scripts/bootstrap-agent.sh --agent <client>` to refresh the install), or adding reference data.

**When not to:** mid-session personal plans, anything under `scratch/`, or product-repo changes
(those go through the product repo's own flow).
